<title>USA: PremiumWear names David Berg as COO.</title>
<headline>PremiumWear names David Berg as COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PremiumWear Inc said it appointed David Berg to the new position of chief operating officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>It also named James Bury as vice president finance and Cynthia Boeddeker as vice president-general merchandise manager.</p>
<p>Berg previously was executive vice president.</p>
<p>Bury was vice president-controller and Boeddeker, director of sourcing and inventory.</p>
<p>PremiumWear markets Munsingwear brand knit shirts and other apparel items.</p>
<p>	 ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
